From e374d53671c85ec96e6c6f06d053cb99fad4447c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Golle <daniel@makrotopia.org>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 10:50:28 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 08/15] feat: add a generic external control helper protocol

Exchange versioned JSON with configured executables over stdin/stdout
without a shell. Drain both directions concurrently, validate replies,
and map backend failures to SOAP faults. Support an optional uptime
based deadline and reap failed, cancelled and timed-out children.

Test literal executable paths and data, malformed and oversized output,
backend errors, premature exit and child completion after stdout closes.

Signed-off-by: Daniel Golle <daniel@makrotopia.org>
